# The Colors view lists colored projects and notes alongside tasks, each under its color with its path.
file <<END
Garden: @green
	Soil notes @green
	- Water @yellow
Shed:
	Tools: @yellow
END
keys gC
see 󰏘 Yellow
see - Water  Garden
see Tools:  Shed
see 󰏘 Green
see Garden:
see Soil notes  Garden
quit
